      "class": "state_transition",
      "contract": "Default lifetimes: access JWT (userId, username, type access) expires after 1 hour, refresh JWT (type refresh) after 30 days, sessions.expiresAt about 30 days, grace about 10 minutes. A successful refresh rotates the session: new refreshToken in the single sessions row, previous token in lastRefreshToken with lastRefreshTokenExpiresAt, and a rotated refresh cookie (HttpOnly, Path=/, SameSite=Lax, 30 day MaxAge, Secure per request) whose value equals the stored token; the new access token authorizes.",
